    rectangle "==Effects\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nParticles, floating text and flyers (resources homing into the pack), with budgets and a flyer lifetime so bursts stay cheap." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Effects
    rectangle "==Storage\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript + localStorage]</size>\n\nGuarded localStorage: load, save (reporting failures, never over another tab's save) and setting aside a save it can't read rather than writing over it, plus per-browser view settings. The depot prototype uses separate save/aside keys and retained per-seed archives, rejects cross-slot adoption, and disables room connections." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsUHJlc2VudGF0aW9u>> as MORETHANENOUGH.WebApplication.Storage
